 rising premiums and coverage withdrawals in flood/fire zones are repricing assets that the market once treated as perpetuities.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Valued at a 22% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Gross margin tops the Real Estate peer set \u2014 genuine pricing power is present here","Real Estate sector outperforming the broader market over the past quarter"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Will Alpine Income Property Trust (NYSE:PINE) Benefit From Rising Dividend?","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/stocks/infrastructure-and-real-estate/will-alpine-income-property-trust-nysepine-benefit-from-rising-dividend","date":"2026-11-18","timestamp":1795024140.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.919,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["dividend"]},{"title":"Analyzing Acadia Realty Trust (NYSE:AKR) and Alpine Income Property Trust (NYSE:PINE)","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/15/analyzing-acadia-realty-trust-nyseakr-and-alpine-income-property-trust-nysepine.html","date":"2026-11-15","timestamp":1794770464.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.964,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Alpine Income Property Trust (NYSE:PINE) Given New $17.00 Price Target at Truist Financial","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/03/alpine-income-property-trust-nysepine-given-new-17-00-price-target-at-truist-financial.html","date":"2026-11-03","timestamp":1793724893.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.832,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["analyst_action"]},{"title":"Understanding the Setup: (PINE) and Scalable Risk","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/34/Understanding_the_Setup:_PINE_and_Scalable_Risk_110326015201_1793688721.html","date":"2026-11-03","timestamp":1793688721.0,"or